{
  "source": "fa06143bfc32cf69",
  "nav": "键盘快捷键",
  "title": "键盘快捷键",
  "seoTitle": "Codevalanche 键盘快捷键",
  "description": "Codevalanche 中所有默认键盘快捷键：命令面板、新对话、语音模式、窗格、消息框。均可在设置中更改。",
  "body": "<p>可在“设置 › <span class=\"ui-term\">键盘快捷键</span>”中更改、添加或重置快捷键。只属于某一处的快捷键（例如消息框中的快捷键）是固定的。</p>\n<h2 id=\"global\">全局</h2>\n<div class=\"docs-table-wrap\"><table class=\"docs-table\"><thead><tr><th>按键</th><th>操作</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><kbd class=\"docs-kbd\">Ctrl</kbd>+<kbd class=\"docs-kbd\">K</kbd></td><td>打开命令面板</td></tr><tr><td><kbd class=\"docs-kbd\">Ctrl</kbd>+<kbd class=\"docs-kbd\">I</kbd></td><td>聚焦消息框</td></tr><tr><td><kbd class=\"docs-kbd\">Ctrl</kbd>+<kbd class=\"docs-kbd\">N</kbd></td><td>新对话</td></tr><tr><td><kbd class=\"docs-kbd\">Ctrl</kbd>+<kbd class=\"docs-kbd\">Shift</kbd>+<kbd class=\"docs-kbd\">N</kbd></td><td>新窗口</td></tr><tr><td><kbd class=\"docs-kbd\">Ctrl</kbd>+<kbd class=\"docs-kbd\">O</kbd></td><td>打开文件夹</td></tr><tr><td><kbd class=\"docs-kbd\">Ctrl</kbd>+<kbd class=\"docs-kbd\">,</kbd></td><td>打开设置</td></tr><tr><td><kbd class=\"docs-kbd\">Ctrl</kbd>+<kbd class=\"docs-kbd\">F</kbd></td><td>搜索对话</td></tr><tr><td><kbd class=\"docs-kbd\">Ctrl</kbd>+<kbd class=\"docs-kbd\">Shift</kbd>+<kbd class=\"docs-kbd\">Space</kbd></td><td>开始或停止语音模式</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<h2 id=\"panes\">窗格与布局</h2>\n<div class=\"docs-table-wrap\"><table class=\"docs-table\"><thead><tr><th>按键</th><th>操作</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><kbd class=\"docs-kbd\">Ctrl</kbd>+<kbd class=\"docs-kbd\">1</kbd></td><td>显示或隐藏文件</td></tr><tr><td><kbd class=\"docs-kbd\">Ctrl</kbd>+<kbd class=\"docs-kbd\">2</kbd></td><td>显示或隐藏更改</td></tr><tr><td><kbd class=\"docs-kbd\">Ctrl</kbd>+<kbd class=\"docs-kbd\">3</kbd></td><td>显示或隐藏浏览器</td></tr><tr><td><kbd class=\"docs-kbd\">Ctrl</kbd>+<kbd class=\"docs-kbd\">4</kbd></td><td>显示或隐藏终端窗格</td></tr><tr><td><kbd class=\"docs-kbd\">Ctrl</kbd>+<kbd class=\"docs-kbd\">5</kbd></td><td>显示或隐藏侧边聊天</td></tr><tr><td><kbd class=\"docs-kbd\">Ctrl</kbd>+<kbd class=\"docs-kbd\">\\</kbd></td><td>关闭所有窗格</td></tr><tr><td><kbd class=\"docs-kbd\">Ctrl</kbd>+<kbd class=\"docs-kbd\">B</kbd></td><td>显示或隐藏项目侧边栏</td></tr><tr><td><kbd class=\"docs-kbd\">Ctrl</kbd>+<kbd class=\"docs-kbd\">J</kbd></td><td>显示或隐藏终端</td></tr><tr><td><kbd class=\"docs-kbd\">Ctrl</kbd>+<kbd class=\"docs-kbd\">P</kbd></td><td>打开文件面板</td></tr><tr><td><kbd class=\"docs-kbd\">Ctrl</kbd>+<kbd class=\"docs-kbd\">T</kbd></td><td>打开浏览器面板</td></tr><tr><td><kbd class=\"docs-kbd\">Ctrl</kbd>+<kbd class=\"docs-kbd\">Alt</kbd>+<kbd class=\"docs-kbd\">S</kbd></td><td>打开侧边聊天</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<h2 id=\"composer\">在消息框中</h2>\n<div class=\"docs-table-wrap\"><table class=\"docs-table\"><thead><tr><th>按键</th><th>操作</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><kbd class=\"docs-kbd\">Enter</kbd></td><td>发送；如果有运行正在进行，则加入队列</td></tr><tr><td><kbd class=\"docs-kbd\">Shift</kbd>+<kbd class=\"docs-kbd\">Enter</kbd></td><td>换行</td></tr><tr><td><kbd class=\"docs-kbd\">Esc</kbd></td><td>停止运行</td></tr><tr><td><kbd class=\"docs-kbd\">Ctrl</kbd>+<kbd class=\"docs-kbd\">U</kbd></td><td>添加照片和文件</td></tr><tr><td><code>/</code></td><td>打开斜杠命令</td></tr></tbody></table></div>"
}
